@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach tat ca san pham -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. Chi tiet san pham ID 1 hop le -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. San pham khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found (PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. ID khong phai so -> 404 Not Found (Chan qua route constraint)
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao san pham hop le -> 201 Created + Location header
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### 7. Tao san pham loi (gia am hoac ten rong) -> 400 Bad Request (INVALID_PRODUCT)
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "",
  "price": -1
}

### 8. Sai kieu noi dung (thieu Content-Type json) -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: text/plain

name=Lap+trinh+gRPC
